  {"q": "Why are user profiles valuable to advertisers?", "o": ["They help advertisers reach the right audience.", "They reduce the cost of making apps.", "They make users trust adverts more.", "They are required by law."], "a": 0, "why": "to reach exactly the right audience at exactly the right moment。"},
